IMPORTANT — SCOPE OF THE SOFTWARE

This software validates the GEOMETRIC validity of floorplans and reports hints about
architectural plausibility. It does NOT check, and must not be represented as
checking, legal or regulatory admissibility of any kind, including but not limited to
building regulations, fire safety, escape routes, minimum room dimensions, or
living-area calculation under WoFlV or DIN 277.

Any output of this software is a working document, not a professional statement.
